格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"DSH（DeepSeek Harness）宿主插件：对话完成时提醒你——每当 Agent 结束一轮对话（状态回到 idle，不再主动输出），播放提示音并弹出 Windows 通知，让你切到别的窗口等回复时也不会错过。","id":"gh:1333376022","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-ding","slug":"CAOGGL/dsh-ding","topics":["dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"DSH（DeepSeek Harness）宿主插件：对话完成时提醒你——每当 Agent 结束一轮对话（状态回到 idle，不再主动输出），播放提示音并弹出 Windows 通知，让你切到别的窗口等回"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"Seek Harness）宿主插件：对话完成时提醒你——每当 Agent 结束一轮对话（状态回到 idle，不再主动输出），播放提示音并弹出 Windows 通知，让你切到别的窗口等回复时也不会错过。"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-ding 🔔"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"DSH（DeepSeek Harness）宿主插件：**对话完成时提醒你**——每当 Agent 结束一轮对话（状态回到 idle，不再主动输出），播放提示音并弹出 Windows 通知，让你切到别的"},{"id":"p3s2","text":" Harness）宿主插件：**对话完成时提醒你**——每当 Agent 结束一轮对话（状态回到 idle，不再主动输出），播放提示音并弹出 Windows 通知，让你切到别的窗口等回复时也不会错过。"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"A DSH host plugin that **notifies you when a conversation finishes**: whenever the Agent completes a"},{"id":"p4s2","text":" turn (back to `idle`, no more proactive output), it plays a sound and shows a Windows notification,"},{"id":"p4s3","text":" so you never miss the reply while working in another window."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"**切换语言 / Language：** 中文 · English"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## 中文"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"### 主要功能"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"- 🔔 **提示音**：对话完成后播放提示音——默认使用 `ding.mp3`（可配置任意音频文件：mp3/wav/mid/wma/aac），找不到时回退系统\"叮咚\"双音\n- 🪟 **Windows "},{"id":"p8s2","text":"原生通知**：弹出系统原生 Toast（含会话标题、DSH 蓝鲸图标）。首次使用时自动注册 AppUserModelID（开始菜单快捷方式），确保通知真正显示——未注册的 AUMID 会被 Windo"},{"id":"p8s3","text":"ws 静默丢弃\n- 🎚️ **音量可调**：`volume` 配置项（0.0 ~ 1.0）控制提示音大小，改配置即时生效\n- 🔔 **Web 铃铛按钮**：对话页顶栏有个铃铛——**单击**开关提示音"},{"id":"p8s4","text":"、**悬停**拖音量滑杆（松手自动试听）、**右键**选择音效并可上传自己的音频文件；设置即时保存，无需改配置\n- 🖱️ **通知点击直达会话**：Windows 通知（toast/气泡）**点击后直"},{"id":"p8s5","text":"达输出完成的对话**（快捷方式激活 + `dsh-ding://` 协议）。`dsh web` 启动时打开浏览器并用 `?dingOpen=` 定位会话；**DeepSeek Harness 桌面版*"},{"id":"p8s6","text":"*启动时改为**在应用窗口内直接切换会话**（宿主事件流推送 + `dsh://open` 聚焦窗口），不弹浏览器、也不会撞上 WebUI 的认证拦截\n- 🔕 **当前会话免打扰**：窗口在前台且完成"},{"id":"p8s7","text":"的会话正是你正在查看的会话时静默；切走窗口、看别的会话、或没开对话页时照常提醒\n- ⏱ **长任务运行中提醒**：任务运行超 3 分钟后每 5 分钟提醒一次（只弹通知、不响铃），提醒文本含已运行时长\n"},{"id":"p8s8","text":"- ❓ **用户提问提醒**：Agent 通过 `ask_user_question` 提问等待回答时立即提醒（文本区别于完成通知）\n- 🛡️ **工具审批提醒**：工具调用等待你批准（approva"},{"id":"p8s9","text":"l/request）时立即提醒，点击通知直达该会话，在 WebUI 里完成审批\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"### 安装方法"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"`$DSH_HOME` 默认为 `~/.dsh`。"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"**方法 A：npm 安装（推荐）**"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"也可以直接在项目里装："},{"id":"p14s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"装完**重启 `dsh web`** 生效。已发布版本见 https://www.npmjs.com/package/dsh-ding 。"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"**方法 B：从 GitHub 安装（bundle）**"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"依赖 pnpm（`npm install -g pnpm` 即可）。本插件也支持 insert 行挂载（改配置即时生效），见方法 D。"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"**方法 C：插件市场**"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"设置 → 插件市场 → 搜索 `dsh-ding` → 一键安装（已收录于 awesome-dsh-plugin，市场目录每日刷新后出现）。"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"**方法 D：手动放置（无需 pnpm）**"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"1. 把本仓库克隆（或下载）到：`$DSH_HOME/profiles/node_modules/dsh-ding/`\n2. 在 profile 的用户补丁 `$DSH_HOME/profiles/w"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"eb/cordis.patch.yml`（其他 profile 同理）追加："},{"id":"p23s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"3. 保存即生效（补丁文件是热监控的）；插件代码本身的改动需要重启服务才生效。"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"**验证**：对话完成后应听到提示音并看到通知；也可以先单独测试通知脚本："},{"id":"p26s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"### 配置"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"| 配置项 | 默认值 | 说明 |"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"| `sound` | `true` | 播放提示音 |\n| `soundFile` | 空 | 提示音文件路径（mp3/wav/mid/wma/aac）。留空时自动在 服务器工作目录 / 插件目录（"},{"id":"p29s2","text":"**自带 ding.mp3**）/ 用户主目录 找 `ding.mp3`，找不到则回退系统\"叮咚\"双音 |\n| `volume` | `1.0` | 提示音音量（0.0 ~ 1.0，1.0 为原始音量"},{"id":"p29s3","text":"，如 `0.5` 即一半音量） |\n| `balloon` | `true` | 显示 Windows 通知 |\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"### Features"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"- 🔔 **Sound alert**: plays `ding.mp3` (configurable to any audio file: mp3/wav/mid/wma/aac) when a c"},{"id":"p31s2","text":"onversation completes; falls back to the system \"ding-dong\" beep if the file is missing\n- 🪟 **Native"},{"id":"p31s3","text":" Windows notification**: shows a system toast (including the session title and the DSH whale logo). "},{"id":"p31s4","text":"On first use the plugin registers an AppUserModelID (Start Menu shortcut) so the toast is actually d"},{"id":"p31s5","text":"isplayed — toasts with an unregistered AUMID are silently dropped by Windows\n- 🎚️ **Adjustable volum"},{"id":"p31s6","text":"e**: the `volume` option (0.0 ~ 1.0) controls the alert loudness; config changes apply immediately\n-"},{"id":"p31s7","text":" 🔔 **Web bell button**: a bell in the conversation header — **click** toggles the sound, **hover** s"},{"id":"p31s8","text":"lides a volume bar out on the left of the bell (in-flow width animation; the other items in the row "},{"id":"p31s9","text":"shift left), **right-click** opens the notification settings panel: sound/toast toggles (both off = "},{"id":"p31s10","text":"no notification at all), sound picker and upload; changes save immediately, no config editing\n- 🖱️ *"},{"id":"p31s11","text":"*Click the notification to jump to the conversation**: clicking the Windows toast/balloon **lands on"},{"id":"p31s12","text":" the finished conversation** (shortcut activation + `dsh-ding://` protocol). With `dsh web` it opens"},{"id":"p31s13","text":" the browser and uses the `?dingOpen=` deep link; with the **DeepSeek Harness desktop app** it **swi"},{"id":"p31s14","text":"tches the conversation inside the app window** instead (host event-stream push + `dsh://open` to foc"},{"id":"p31s15","text":"us), so no browser pops up and the WebUI authentication gate is never hit\n- 🔕 **Quiet on current**: "},{"id":"p31s16","text":"silent while the window is focused AND the finishing session is the one you are viewing; still remin"},{"id":"p31s17","text":"ds when you switch away, view another session, or no conversation page is open\n- ⏱ **Long-task progr"},{"id":"p31s18","text":"ess reminder**: first toast after 3 minutes, then every 5 minutes (toast only, no sound), with the e"},{"id":"p31s19","text":"lapsed time in the text\n- ❓ **Question reminder**: alerts immediately when the agent asks you via `a"},{"id":"p31s20","text":"sk_user_question` and waits (text differs from completion)\n[该节后续省略]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
